       fhir:path [ fhir:v "BiologicallyDerivedProduct.identifier" ] ;
       fhir:short [ fhir:v "Under most circumstances an MPHO will be uniquely identified using a single identifier from production to point of use. In some cases, a second identifier may be required (for example, import from another country that uses a different identification coding system).  In these cases, both the original and new identifier must be included." ] ;
