       fhir:short [ fhir:v "A set of resources composed into a single coherent clinical statement with clinical attestation" ] ;
       fhir:definition [ fhir:v "A set of healthcare-related information that is assembled together into a single logical document that provides a single coherent statement of meaning, establishes its own context and that has clinical attestation with regard to who is making the statement. While a Composition defines the structure, it does not actually contain the content: rather the full content of a document is contained in a Bundle, of which the Composition is the first resource contained." ] ;
