       fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Identifier.system is always case sensitive. The FHIR specification, terminology.hl7.org and HL7 affiliates (for identifiers specific to their jurisdiction) define identifier systems that SHALL be used for certain types of identifiers.  Specific rules can be found [here](identifier-registry.html)." ] ;
       fhir:requirements [ fhir:v "There are many sets  of identifiers.  To perform matching of two identifiers, we need to know what set we're dealing with. The system identifies a particular set of unique identifiers." ] ;
